    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Havana is nirvana for the vintage automobile enthusiast. Call \u2018em classic cars, collectible vehicles or just beat-up matter on wheels, we had the pleasure of riding in Dennis\u2019s proud \u201957 Buick. And oh yes, we thrilled cruising in a CocoTaxi.",
      "style": ""
