      "type": "p",
      "text": "Sunsets and Night Shots",
      "style": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "One of the splendid features of my Olympus is the 5-Axis Image Stabilization system that would allow me to take night shots sans tripod with minimum blur caused by camera shake. The results were pleasing. Evening sunsets and dimly lit outlines appeared sharp.",
      "style": ""
    },
    {
